nsommateurs et l\'application de la r\\u00e9glementation relative aux produits et aux services. Nous aidons les consommateurs \\u00e0 faire valoir leurs droits en cas de probl\\u00e8mes de qualit\\u00e9, de s\\u00e9curit\\u00e9 ou de tromperie.\",\"link\":{\"is_external\":\"\",\"url\":\"#\"},\"image_space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":27},\"image_size\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100},\"text_align\":\"center\",\"title_bottom_space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":12},\"title_color\":\"#333333\",\"title_typography_line_height_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":\"\"},\"title_typography_line_height_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":\"\"},\"description_color\":\"#545454\",\"description_typography_line_height_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":\"\"},\"description_typography_line_height_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":\"\"},\"_css_classes\":\"areas-box\",\"_background_background\":\"classic\",\"_background_color\":\"#f6f6f6\",\"title_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"title_typography_letter_spacing\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1.2,\"sizes\":[]},\"_border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"5\",\"right\":\"5\",\"bottom\":\"5\",\"left\":\"5\",\"isLinked\":true},\"title_size\":\"h2\",\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"30\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"thumbnail_size\":\"ocean-thumb-ml\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image-box\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"phobwjz\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":33,\"_inline_size\":null,\"_inline_size_tablet\":50},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"clyq47f\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8081\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/01\\/mika-baumeister-u29d3Qwbz58-unsplash.jpg\",\"id\":1085,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"title_text\":\"Droit d\'int\\u00e9r\\u00eat public\",\"description_text\":\"Nous travaillons pour promouvoir la justice sociale et prot\\u00e9ger les droits des communaut\\u00e9s d\\u00e9favoris\\u00e9es et marginalis\\u00e9es, en nous engageant dans des actions de plaidoyer et de d\\u00e9fense juridique.\",\"link\":{\"is_external\":\"\",\"url\":\"#\"},\"image_space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":27},\"image_size\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100},\"text_align\":\"center\",\"title_bottom_space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":12},\"title_color\":\"#333333\",\"title_typography_line_height_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":\"\"},\"title_typography_line_height_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":\"\"},\"description_color\":\"#545454\",\"description_typography_line_height_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":\"\"},\"description_typography_line_height_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":\"\"},\"_css_classes\":\"areas-box\",\"_background_background\":\"classic\",\"_background_color\":\"#f6f6f6\",\"title_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"title_typography_letter_spacing\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1.2,\"sizes\":[]},\"_border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"5\",\"right\":\"5\",\"bottom\":\"5\",\"left\":\"5\",\"isLinked\":true},\"title_size\":\"h2\",\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"30\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"thumbnail_size\":\"ocean-thumb-ml\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image-box\"},{\"id\":\"mfva3rv\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/lawyer.oceanwp.org\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/04\\/pa-07.jpg\",\"id\":732,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"title_text\":\"Droit de la sant\\u00e9\",\"description_text\":\"Nous nous sp\\u00e9cialisons dans le droit de la sant\\u00e9 et la protection de la sant\\u00e9 des individus. Nous aidons les patients \\u00e0 faire valoir leurs droits et \\u00e0 obtenir justice en cas de mauvais traitements ou de n\\u00e9gligence m\\u00e9dicale.\",\"link\":{\"is_external\":\"\",\"url\":\"#\"},\"image_space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":27},\"image_size\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100},\"text_align\":\"center\",\"title_bottom_space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":12},\"title_col