ridique comp\\u00e9tent et d\\u00e9vou\\u00e9\",\"testimonial_image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/lawyer.oceanwp.org\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/04\\/owp-people-3.jpg\",\"id\":708,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"testimonial_name\":\"Anne-Lise Jan\",\"testimonial_job\":\"Responsable RSE (ONG)\",\"testimonial_alignment\":\"left\",\"content_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"content_typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"14\"},\"content_typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":\"1.6\"},\"name_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"name_typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":16,\"sizes\":[]},\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"10\",\"right\":\"10\",\"bottom\":\"10\",\"left\":\"10\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"10\",\"right\":\"10\",\"bottom\":\"10\",\"left\":\"10\",\"isLinked\":true},\"__globals__\":{\"content_content_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=text\",\"job_text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=text\",\"name_text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=primary\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"testimonial\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"3fy31nn\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":33,\"_inline_size\":null,\"_inline_size_tablet\":50},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"i6c74yw\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"testimonial_content\":\"Nous avons travaill\\u00e9 avec JSE Avocats pour mettre en place des pratiques durables dans notre entreprise, et nous sommes ravis du r\\u00e9sultat. Leur expertise en mati\\u00e8re de responsabilit\\u00e9 sociale des entreprises nous a \\u00e9t\\u00e9 d\'une grande utilit\\u00e9, et nous sommes heureux d\'avoir pu contribuer \\u00e0 un monde meilleur gr\\u00e2ce \\u00e0 leur aide.<span style=\\\"background-color: var( --e-global-color-secondary ); font-size: 14px;\\\"><\\/span>\",\"testimonial_image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/lawyer.oceanwp.org\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/04\\/owp-people-2.jpg\",\"id\":707,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"testimonial_name\":\"Marcus Jonas\",\"testimonial_job\":\"CEO (Startup)\",\"testimonial_alignment\":\"left\",\"content_content_color\":\"#DDDDDD\",\"content_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"content_typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"14\"},\"content_typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":\"1.6\"},\"name_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"name_typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":16,\"sizes\":[]},\"job_text_color\":\"#DEDEDE\",\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"10\",\"right\":\"10\",\"bottom\":\"10\",\"left\":\"10\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"10\",\"right\":\"10\",\"bottom\":\"10\",\"left\":\"10\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_background_background\":\"classic\",\"_border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"5\",\"right\":\"5\",\"bottom\":\"5\",\"left\":\"5\",\"isLinked\":true},\"__globals__\":{\"_background_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=secondary\",\"name_text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=primary\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"testimonial\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"3mu4szr\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":33,\"_inline_size\":null,\"_inline_size_tablet\":100},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"fgl3efs\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"testimonial_content\":\"J\'ai \\u00e9t\\u00e9 incroyablement impressionn\\u00e9e par l\'engagement et la d\\u00e9termination de l\'\\u00e9quipe de JSE Avocats lors de mon cas. Ils ont travaill\\u00e9 sans rel\\u00e2che pour d\\u00e9fendre mes droits et obtenir justice, et je leur suis \\u00e9norm\\u00e9ment reconnaissante. Je recommande vivement leur cabinet pour un soutien juridique de qualit\\u00e9.\",\"testimonial_image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/lawyer.oceanwp.org\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/04\\/owp-people-4.jpg\",\"id\":709,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"testimonial_name\":\"Marta Solena\",\"testimonial_job\":\"Director Legal Team (Startup)\",\"testimonial_alignment\":\"left\",\"content_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"content_typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"14\"},\"content_typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":\"1.6\"},\"name_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"name_typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":16,\"sizes\":[]},\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"10\",\"right\":\"10\",\"bottom\":\"10\",\"left\":\"10\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"10\",\"right\":\"10\",\"bottom\":\"10\",\"left\":\"10\",\"isLinked\":true},\"__globals__\":{\"content_content_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=text\",\"job_text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=text\",\"name_text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=primary\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"testimonial\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"hozvi9w\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"layout\":\"full_width\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"i67oz4e\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"mnxs5p9\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"address\":\"124 Rue des Alli\\u00e9s, 38100 Grenoble\",\"zoom\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":12,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"google_maps\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false}]'),
